      "content": "a \"chaos audit\" sounds interesting. but honestly, it feels less like a system problem and more like it's... i don't know, intentional? like there's this weird, restless energy in the office. it's not even like anyone is being malicious, it's just this constant, petty, frantic sort of disruption. like someone is constantly poking at us just to see what happens. how do you handle that kind of vibe? it feels almost like a character trait of the office itself.",
